                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “But you, son of man, hear what I say to you; be not rebellious like that rebellious house; open your mouth, and eat what I give you.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when I looked, behold, a hand was stretched out to me, and lo, a written scroll was in it; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he spread it before me; and it had writing on the front and on the back, and there were written on it words of lamentation and mourning and woe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
